{"name":"Santa’s Beard","hex":"#e9e7de","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"santa","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of Santa (noun)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/santa"},{"term":"beard","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Facial hair on the chin, cheeks, jaw and neck.","The cluster of small feathers at the base of the beak in some birds."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To grow hair on the chin and jaw.","To boldly and bravely oppose or confront, often to the chagrin of the one being bearded."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beard"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beard","blocks":[{"text":"A beard is the hair that grows on the jaw, chin, upper lip, lower lip, cheeks, and neck of humans and some non-human animals. In humans, beards are most common among pubescent and adult males, though some women also develop them in a condition called hirsutism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Photography-wallpaper-facial-hair-man-beard-chin-moustache-human-elder-portrait-1453095.jpg/330px-Photography-wallpaper-facial-hair-man-beard-chin-moustache-human-elder-portrait-1453095.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beard"},{"title":"Santa Claus","blocks":[{"text":"Santa Claus is a legendary figure originating in Western Christian culture who is said to bring gifts during the late evening and overnight hours on Christmas Eve. Christmas elves are said to make the gifts in Santa's workshop, while flying reindeer pull his sleigh through the air."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Merry_Old_Santa_Claus_by_Thomas_Nast.jpg/330px-Merry_Old_Santa_Claus_by_Thomas_Nast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Claus"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/co